# KiriChess - project overview

Single source of truth for repo layout and verification commands. Read this before any cross-cutting work.

## Stack

- **Backend:** ASP.NET Core minimal API, EF Core, PostgreSQL, Redis, SignalR - `src/KiriChess.Server/`
- **Engine:** `src/KiriChess.Engine/` (pure chess logic)
- **Frontend:** Next.js App Router - `ui/` (package name is `"web"`, directory is `ui/`)
- **Tests:** `tests/KiriChess.Server.Tests/`, `tests/KiriChess.Engine.Tests/`, `tests/KiriChess.Simulator.Tests/`
- **Simulator:** `simulator/KiriChess.Simulator/` (Stockfish / random self-play through the engine)
- **Solution:** `KiriChess.slnx` (not `.sln`)

## Path map (do not use legacy names)

| Wrong (old template)             | Correct (KiriChess)     |
| -------------------------------- | ----------------------- |
| `backend/`                       | `src/KiriChess.Server/` |
| `src/` as frontend               | `ui/`                   |
| `frontend/`, `web/`              | `ui/`                   |
| Scattered `CLAUDE.md` in subdirs | `.claude/rules/*.md`    |

## Verify before declaring done

```bash
dotnet test KiriChess.slnx
cd ui && npm run lint && npx tsc --noEmit && npm test && npm run build
cd ui && npm run gen:api:check   # OpenAPI client freshness
```

## Conventions location

Project conventions live in `.claude/rules/`:

- `.claude/rules/project.md` - this file
- `.claude/rules/frontend.md` - Next.js / `ui/` patterns
- `.claude/rules/styling.md` - how `ui/` looks: tokens, page shells, type, cards, buttons, forms
- `.claude/rules/backend.md` - C# server patterns
- `.claude/rules/realtime.md` - SignalR, live games, clocks
- `.claude/rules/engine.md` - chess rules and determinism
- `.claude/rules/security.md` - auth, sessions, rate limiting
- `.claude/rules/testing.md` - which tests a change needs

Human documentation lives under `docs/` - map in [`docs/README.md`](../../docs/README.md). Living drafts in `docs/plans/` are not standing rules. Do not drop new standing docs at `docs/*.md`; they belong in `game/`, `ops/`, `decisions/`, `legal/`, or `audits/`. `docs/RULES.md` and `docs/ROADMAP.md` stay at that root on purpose.

## OpenAPI / API client

HTTP DTOs are generated - do not hand-write mirrors in `ui/lib/types.ts`. After backend API changes:

1. Export OpenAPI: `dotnet run --project src/KiriChess.Server -- --export-openapi docs/api/openapi.json`
2. Regenerate client: `cd ui && npm run gen:api`
